Welcome to our Academy
Our exceptional academy ensures every student thrives academically and personally.
Welcome to Harris Girls’ Academy East Dulwich. Our outstanding academy is a happy, richly diverse, warm, and welcoming community where every student is supported to become academically and personally successful. Our smaller setting ensures we know our students as individuals, enabling us to provide personalised support to ensure every student thrives.
